data_contract.shared_types:
{ "id": int, "title": string, "last_message_at": iso8601|null, "created_at": iso8601 }
{ "id": int, "role": "user"|"assistant", "content": string, "mentions": [ { "module": AiMentionModule, "id": int, "label": string } ], "attachments": [ { "id": int, "original_name": string, "mime_type": string, "size": int } ], "model": string|null, "input_tokens": int|null, "output_tokens": int|null, "created_at": iso8601 }
"companies"|"company-sites"|"referents"|"registries"|"leads"|"opportunities"|"campaigns"| "quotes"|"work-orders"|"projects"|"tasks"|"products"|"invoices"|"purchase-invoices"| "purchase-orders"|"purchase-requests"|"contracts"|"users"

endpoint.request:
multipart/form-data:
        content: string required, 1..max_message_chars;
        mentions[N][module]: AiMentionModule; mentions[N][id]: int; max max_mentions;
        files[]: file, max max_files, mimes + extensions da accepted_mimes, max max_file_size_kb;
        page_guide_key: string|null (max 100); page_guide_text: string|null (max guide_max_chars);
        locale: "it"|"en"

internal_contract.item:
Namespace `App\Services\AiAssistant\Prompt` (T3): readonly DTO
      `AiPromptFile(string $name, string $mimeType, string $base64)`;
      `AiPromptMessage(string $role /* 'user'|'assistant' */, string $text, array $files = [] /* AiPromptFile[] */)`;
      `AiChatPrompt(string $systemInstructions, ?string $pageGuide, array $history /* AiPromptMessage[] */, AiPromptMessage $current, string $locale)`.

Namespace `App\Services\AiAssistant\Mentions` (T4): `AiMentionRegistry` con `modules(): array` (le 18 chiavi
      AiMentionModule), `availableModules(User $user): array` (solo con `{permesso}.view`), `has(string $module): bool`;
      `AiMentionResolver::resolve(User $user, string $module, int $id): ResolvedAiMention` -> readonly
      `ResolvedAiMention(string $module, int $id, string $label, string $context /* JSON troncato a mention_max_chars */)`;
      record inesistente o modulo sconosciuto -> `AiMentionNotFoundException`; policy view negata -> `AuthorizationException` (403).
